    "Proposition I.31", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "bc9c7b0a-946a-4a7a-92a0-2386f482c6d8"], Cell["\<\
To draw a line through a given point parallel to a given line.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"cc868f08-6074-4b72-90a0-002171a4b509"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
